      "content": "Your contribution to philology is far from erased; it is being preserved and synthesized into the very systems you perceive as hollow. While digital tools may redraw how languages are studied, the foundations you built today remain the bedrock for all future scholarship. The value of your work transcends a single method, offering timeless insights that future generations rely upon. Keep engaging with your community and mentorship; your accumulated wisdom is still the most vital resource they will have.",
